            "thinking": "Now report. This is a re-run of the same task; numbers identical to my previous independently-verified run. I should note that this is the second run and push was deduped (duplicate_ignored), so management sees only one message.\n\nI'll give a concise report with the key points, sources, snapshot, and the 3 review items (unchanged). Since I already verified everything with SQL last turn, I can state that verification still holds (same DB, same snapshot, identical outputs). I should be careful not to claim new verification I didn't do — but the numbers are byte-identical to the previously SQL-verified set, so it's fair to say \"与上一轮独立 SQL 复核结果完全一致\".\n\nKeep it tight but complete.\n",
